// learn site calls the learn, and cleared right after it, under gXdLock like the pass. While gLiSel.use is 0 (111 OFF or SHADOW,
// and between learn calls) li111_learn_off() is N48_LUT_SLOT4_OFF and li111_accept() is N48_LUT_OK: the learn is 0.0.552's.
// =============================================================================================================================
