// 0.0.317: COUNTING IS NOT WITNESSING - the resolver's own instrument, applied to itself.
// `no identity 6` has been reported by three runs (m4c3, m4c7, m4c8) and the only address it ever named was the LAST
// ask, so "WHICH programs" has been an inference every time. This table records every DISTINCT (stage, VA) the
