// build 0.0.521 Part C: run10v spent the 64 lines by F123, so a later producer recurrence went unlogged.
// A frame the content scan judged THE PRODUCER (gfx_clock88.h n48_c88_ct_judge) is logged under a cap of its own
// (N48_C88_DETAIL_S), counted here, and only then under the general cap (n48_c88_detail_take). Log-only.
