    // no segment can ever span an IB boundary (the gate re-proves the same property, B5/H2). The headless fallback is NOT
    // run for nib > 1 (B2: ENCODER only): it recognises one encoder stream, not a concatenation of them. OFF (`mib` 0) this
    // is 0.0.425's single call, `ns` and `total` exactly as before.
