        // XLAT12_EXTRA_RASTER_PER_DRAW is a flag that ALREADY EXISTS in xlat12_ib.h; nothing before this build
        // task set it. It is valid only together with XLAT12_EXTRA_RASTER (its own header comment) - a segment with
