        // handed COMMIT from this moment", which is TRUE at budget 1 and A LIE at any budget above it: n48_cm_shot_spend
        // leaves the state ARMED while `spent < budget`, so the next frame that clears every rung commits too. asked
        // for the reword and 0.0.390 did not do it. The line now READS THE BUDGET rather than asserting a consequence of
        // one value of it, and it says which of the two worlds this boot is in, in words, from the same numbers.
        // 0.0.444 (item 5(i)): NEVER printed when the ring push itself failed - this frame was not handed COMMIT,
