        // self-satisfied rule, UNRESOLVED (a real gfxc_page walk), NOT-WRITABLE (COUNTED ONLY - see gfx_memdst.h's
        // own comment on kMdNotWritableConfirmed, item D), COUNT (against the translator's own r4 sums). ENFORCE
        // folds the answer into `live` and into the gate's own redundant N48_CM_MEMDST rung, and discharges R4's
        // wait/write refusal on a clean verdict; SHADOW counts what ENFORCE would have refused and touches nothing
        // that gates. OFF, gMdMode is 0: the scan never runs and gXdBuild.md_ok/gate/R4 are all exactly 0.0.439's.
        //
